    "growth_rate_source": "judgment: Real Estate FFO/unit trajectory (FY2026 guide midpoint $13.25, H1-26 +7.5% y/y partly acquisition-driven) net of refinancing drag; book-value and EPS CAGRs rejected",
    "growth_divergence_warning": "Equity (13-21%) and EPS (30-32%) CAGRs diverge >30% from revenue (6.4-6.7%). Both are distorted by the FY2025 Taubman remeasurement gain (NI $5,364M; equity $3,492M -> $6,472M) and by FY2020 COVID base effects. Not usable as growth proxies.",
    "notes": "Owner-FCF CAGRs use consolidated reported FCF less estimated SBC (~$55-70M/yr, untagged in XBRL) and equity-award taxes; 5yr starts from the COVID-depressed FY2020 base, 3yr (FY22-25) shows near-flat consolidated FCF. SBC is <2% of FCF so the adjusted and reported CAGRs barely differ."
